  ],
  "solution": [
    "Distribute: \\(0.2x - 1 + 0.5x = 0.3x + 3\\), so \\(0.7x - 1 = 0.3x + 3\\).",
    "Subtract \\(0.3x\\) and add 1: \\(0.4x = 4\\).",
    "Then \\(x = 10\\)."
